OL,3,GNEWSALook North red sofa push for
OL,4,AChildren in Need begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC Look North big red sofa is
OL,7,Fbeing pushed across Yorkshire this
OL,8,Fweek, as presenter Amy Garcia is joined
OL,9,Fby Lindsey Burrow for this year's
OL,10,FChildren in Need charity challenge.
OL,12,FLindsey is no stranger to fundraising
OL,13,Fas she has previously run several
OL,14,Fmarathons in memory of her late
OL,15,Fhusband, Leeds rugby league legend Rob
OL,16,FBurrow.
OL,18,FLast year, she joined Amy to raise tens
OL,19,Fof thousands of pounds by doing a
OL,20,Fthree-legged walk for Children in Need.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
